        "Content": "FINAL REMAINING HOME - CEDARVALE, TORQUAY ROAD – VIEWING BY APPOINTMENT\r\n\r\nDNG New Homes and Oakwood Group are delighted to present The Colt Collection, an exclusive development of just four high-quality detached family homes in Foxrock, Dublin 18.\r\n\r\nThis stunning new collection will include two exceptional 5-bedroom residences, extending to c. 259 sq.m / 2,788 sq.ft, superbly positioned on Torquay Road, one of Dublin’s most prestigious and sought-after addresses.\r\n\r\nThe Colt Collection is perfectly situated on Torquay Road and Golf Lane, in the heart of Foxrock—an area renowned for its elegance, tranquillity and established neighbourhood charm. This prime location offers effortless access to a wealth of amenities, including top-tier schools, boutique shops, cafés, restaurants and a host of sporting and recreational facilities. The nearby suburbs of Blackrock, Monkstown, Sandyford and Dundrum further enhance lifestyle options, offering everything from coastal walks to premium retail destinations.\r\n\r\nJust a short stroll from the charming villages of Foxrock —and moments from the Central Park Luas stop—this exceptional setting blends the serenity of leafy suburban living with seamless connectivity to Dublin’s most dynamic amenities.\r\n\r\nFoxrock Village itself is a vibrant, upscale neighbourhood celebrated for its exclusive boutiques and superb dining, including favourites such as The Gables and KERB. For food lovers, Thomas’s of Foxrock provides a premium selection of fine foods and wines, adding to the area’s refined local offering.\r\n\r\nThe Colt Collection offers an exceptional setting for those who love to stay active. Residents are just moments from Foxrock Golf Club and within easy reach of Leopardstown Golf Centre, along with a selection of local rugby, tennis and GAA clubs. The nearby Leopardstown Racecourse adds to the lifestyle appeal, hosting events throughout the year and creating a dynamic environment for both sport and socialising.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the development’s exceptional access to some of Dublin’s most prestigious schools. Close by, Nord Anglia International School Dublin offers a world-class curriculum for international families, while Loreto College Foxrock—a distinguished and highly regarded secondary school for girls—is just a stone’s throw away. Additionally, leading institutions such as Blackrock College, St. Andrew’s College, and University College Dublin (UCD) at Belfield are all within easy reach, ensuring your children benefit from outstanding educational opportunities.\r\n\r\nNestled within this remarkable setting, the homes feature meticulous craftsmanship and contemporary architectural design. Each residence combines superior finishes with modern comfort, style and elegance—delivering an exceptional standard of luxury living in one of Dublin’s most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nWhat’s Coming in 2026:\r\n\r\nA limited collection of exclusive homes, designed for discerning buyers.\r\n\r\nModern, energy-efficient features with an emphasis on sustainability.\r\n\r\nA prestigious Foxrock location offering suburban serenity and exceptional urban connectivity.\r\n\r\nStay tuned for further updates as we share more details on these exclusive residences throughout the year. This is a rare opportunity to secure your place in one of Dublin’s most coveted neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nRegister now for the latest information on this exclusive development or contact DNG New Homes on 01 491 2600."
